cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "FCV — Floor–Ceiling Validation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Floor–Ceiling Validation, an admission test for
  metaheuristics. A method is admitted on a problem only if it beats a parameter-free
  local-search floor in reliability, on instances that are not floor-trivial, with
  quality measured against an exact ceiling. Includes the three problem families
  (knapsack, set covering, uncapacitated facility location) with both planted and
  OR-Library instances, six candidate metaheuristics in vanilla and memetic variants,
  exact ceiling solvers, and the complete per-seed experimental record.
type: software
authors:
